safix::recipients_lost

  × secrets/safix/users/alice/secrets.yaml lost a recipient it had before this
  │ run, so nothing was committed.
  │ 
  │ No longer able to open it:
  │   - age1bob
  │ 
  │ Enrollment is additive and only additive: it appends an identity, appends
  │ a
  │ recipient and re-wraps every governed file to the policy those imply. A
  │ recipient that disappeared in the re-wrap means the policy narrowed for a
  │ reason this run did not ask for — most often a declaration edited between
  │ the last `safix fix` and now.
  │ 
  │ The card's identity and its recipient are written and are correct. Review
  │ what changed, converge deliberately, then re-run:
  │ 
  │     safix check
  │     git diff
